# DuckDB local store
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
# The offline store is tracked deliberately: it is the deployed data, baked into
# the container image now that MotherDuck is gone. 2 MB of synthetic records, no
# secrets, regenerable with `python data/generate.py`. Untracked, a clean clone
# would build an image around a database that does not exist.
!feature_store.duckdb
